A-RL 是一个专为 VLA 模型设计的高效强化学习框架,具有以下创新特点:"}]},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"1. 仅使用结果奖励","id":"rh-7"},{"kind":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"不需要为每个子行为手工设计过程奖励"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"仅使用任务成功/失败的二元信号(0/1)"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"受 LLM 强化学习(DeepSeek-R1)成功经验启发"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"极大提升了方法的可扩展性"}]}]]},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"2. 三大探索增强策略","id":"rh-8"},{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"基于最新 LLM RL 研究,引入三个关键技术增强:"}]},{"kind":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"动态采样(Dynamic Sampling)"}]},{"t":"text","v":":过滤全成功/全失败样本组,确保稳定梯度"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"更高裁剪界(Clip Higher)"}]},{"t":"text","v":":不对称 PPO 裁剪范围,鼓励更大胆的探索"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"更高推理温度(Higher Rollout Temperature)"}]},{"t":"text","v":":生成多样化轨迹,发现新策略"}]}]]},{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"三者结合可在 300 训练步内相比基线提升约 "},{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"30%"}]},{"t":"text","v":"!"}]},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"3. 发现新颖动作模式","id":"rh-9"},{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"训练过程中出现\"推切(Pushcut)\"现象:"}]},{"kind":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"SFT 模型仅学习\"抓取-抬起-移动\"模式"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"RL 训练后自主发现\"推动-滑动\"策略"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"这些动作模式从未在训练数据中出现!"}]}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"证明 RL 能超越人类演示,发现最优策略"}]}]]},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"技术架构","id":"rh-10"},{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"SimpleVLA-RL 构建于以下技术栈:"}]},{"kind":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"基础框架"}]},{"t":"text","v":":"},{"t":"a","href":"https://github.com/volcengine/verl","ext":true,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"veRL"}]},{"t":"text","v":" - 火山引擎 LLM 强化学习框架"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"VLA 模型"}]},{"t":"text","v":":"},{"t":"a","href":"https://github.com/moojink/openvla-oft","ext":true,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"OpenVLA-OFT"}]},{"t":"text","v":" - 7B 参数的开源 VLA 模型"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"模拟环境"}]},{"t":"text","v":":"}]},{"kind":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"a","href":"https://github.com/Lifelong-Robot-Learning/LIBERO","ext":true,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"LIBERO"}]},{"t":"text","v":" - 长时序操作基准测试"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"a","href":"https://github.com/RoboTwin-Platform/RoboTwin","ext":true,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"RoboTwin2.0"}]},{"t":"text","v":" - 双臂操作基准测试"}]}]]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"RL 算法"}]},{"t":"text","v":":Group Relative Policy Optimization (GRPO) + Proximal Policy Optimization (PPO)"}]}]]},{"kind":"hr"},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"🔑 三大关键技术","id":"rh-11"},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"技术一:动态采样(Dynamic Sampling)","id":"rh-12"},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"问题","id":"rh-13"},{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"全成功或全失败的样本组优势方差为零,导致梯度不稳定,训练效率低下。"}]},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"解决方案","id":"rh-14"},{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"仅保留混合结果(部分成功/部分失败)的样本组进行训练:"}]},{"kind":"code","lang":"python","html":"<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#A0ADA0;--shiki-dark:#758575DD\"># 数学表达式(论文公式 10)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91\">0</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\"> |</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">{</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">轨迹_i </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\">|</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\"> 是否成功</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">轨迹_i</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">)}</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\">|</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\"> G</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#A0ADA0;--shiki-dark:#758575DD\"># 实现代码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">data</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">accuracy_lower_bound</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91\">0.1</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#A0ADA0;--shiki-dark:#758575DD\">  # 排除全失败组(0%)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">data</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">accuracy_upper_bound</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91\">0.9</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#A0ADA0;--shiki-dark:#758575DD\">  # 排除全成功组(100%)</span></span></code></pre>"},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"效果","id":"rh-15"},{"kind":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"确保非零优势,提供有意义的学习信号"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"自然形成课程学习,聚焦于适当难度的任务"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"相比基线提升 "},{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"~15%"}]},{"t":"text","v":"(论文图 3a)"}]}]]},{"kind":"hr"},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"技术二:更高裁剪界(Clip Higher)","id":"rh-16"},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"问题","id":"rh-17"},{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"标准 PPO 的对称裁剪 "},{"t":"code","v":"[0.8, 1.2]"},{"t":"text","v":" 限制了低概率动作的概率增长,抑制探索。"}]},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"解决方案","id":"rh-18"},{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"采用不对称裁剪范围 "},{"t":"code","v":"[0.8, 1.28]"},{"t":"text","v":":"}]},{"kind":"code","lang":"bash","html":"<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">actor_rollout_ref.actor.clip_ratio_low</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\">=0.2</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#A0ADA0;--shiki-dark:#758575DD\">   # 下界 1-0.2 = 0.8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">actor_rollout_ref.actor.clip_ratio_high</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\">=0.28</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#A0ADA0;--shiki-dark:#758575DD\">  # 上界 1+0.28 = 1.28</span></span></code></pre>"},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"效果","id":"rh-19"},{"kind":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"允许低概率动作有更大的概率提升空间"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"鼓励探索新的动作模式"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"相比基线提升 "},{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"~10%"}]},{"t":"text","v":"(论文图 3b)"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"灵感来自 DAPO(Yu et al., 2025)"}]}]]},{"kind":"hr"},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"技术三:更高推理温度(Higher Rollout Temperature)","id":"rh-20"},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"问题","id":"rh-21"},{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"低温度(1.0)会导致确定性、重复的轨迹生成,缺乏探索。"}]},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"解决方案","id":"rh-22"},{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"将推理阶段的采样温度从 1.0 提升至 1.6:"}]},{"kind":"code","lang":"bash","html":"<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">actor_rollout_ref.rollout.temperature</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D\">=1.6</span></span></code></pre>"},{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"注意"}]},{"t":"text","v":":仅在推理收集数据时使用,训练时不使用。"}]},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"效果","id":"rh-23"},{"kind":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"生成多样化轨迹,增强探索能力"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"对发现新的成功策略至关重要(如\"推切\"现象)"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"相比基线提升 "},{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"~15%"}]},{"t":"text","v":"(论文图 3c)"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"广泛应用于最新 LLM RL 研究"}]}]]},{"kind":"hr"},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"GRPO 优势估计详解","id":"rh-24"},{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"Group Relative Policy Optimization (GRPO)"}]},{"t":"text","v":" 是专为结果奖励设计的优势估计方法:"}]},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"为什么需要 GRPO?","id":"rh-25"},{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"传统的 Generalized Advantage Estimation (GAE) 需要:"}]},{"kind":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"训练额外的价值网络 V(s)"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"密集的中间奖励信号"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"更复杂的训练流程"}]}]]},{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"GRPO 的优势:"}]},{"kind":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"✅ 无需价值网络"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"✅ 仅需结果奖励"}]}],[{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"✅ 通过组内相对比较进行学习"}]}]]},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"算法原理","id":"rh-26"},{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"对于同一任务的 N 个轨迹:"}]},{"kind":"code","lang":"python","html":"<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#A0ADA0;--shiki-dark:#758575DD\"># 1. 计算每条轨迹的总回报</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">R_i </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\"> Σ 奖励  </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#A0ADA0;--shiki-dark:#758575DD\"># i = 1, 2, ..., N (N=8)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#A0ADA0;--shiki-dark:#758575DD\"># 2. 计算组内平均作为基线</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">baseline </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\"> (</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91\">1</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\">/</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">N</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">)</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\"> × Σ R_i</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#A0ADA0;--shiki-dark:#758575DD\"># 3. 计算优势</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">A_i </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\"> R_i </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\">-</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\"> baseline</span></span></code></pre>"},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"示例","id":"rh-27"},{"kind":"code","lang":"text","html":"<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>任务1的8条轨迹:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>回报: [0.0, 1.0, 0.0, 1.0, 0.0, 1.0, 1.0, 0.0]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>基线: 0.5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>优势: [-0.5, 0.5, -0.5, 0.5, -0.5, 0.5, 0.5, -0.5]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     ↑    ↑    ↑    ↑     ↑    ↑    ↑    ↑</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     差   好   差   好    差   好   好   差</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>含义: 成功的轨迹获得正优势,失败的轨迹获得负优势</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>     策略将学习增加成功轨迹的概率,减少失败轨迹的概率</span></span></code></pre>"},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"PPO 策略更新详解","id":"rh-28"},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"标准 PPO vs SimpleVLA-RL","id":"rh-29"},{"kind":"code","lang":"python","html":"<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#A0ADA0;--shiki-dark:#758575DD\"># 标准 PPO 目标函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">ratio </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\"> π</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">a</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\">|</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">s</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">)</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\"> /</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\"> π_old</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">a</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\">|</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">s</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">clipped_ratio </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\"> clip</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">ratio</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">,</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91\"> 0.8</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">,</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91\"> 1.2</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">)</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#A0ADA0;--shiki-dark:#758575DD\">  # 对称裁剪</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">loss </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\"> -</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#998418;--shiki-dark:#B8A965\">min</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">ratio × A</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">,</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\"> clipped_ratio × A</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#A0ADA0;--shiki-dark:#758575DD\"># SimpleVLA-RL: Clip Higher</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">clipped_ratio </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\"> clip</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">ratio</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">,</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91\"> 0.8</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">,</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91\"> 1.28</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">)</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#A0ADA0;--shiki-dark:#758575DD\">  # 不对称裁剪!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">loss </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\"> -</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#998418;--shiki-dark:#B8A965\">min</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">ratio × A</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">,</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\"> clipped_ratio × A</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">)</span></span></code></pre>"},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"为什么 Clip Higher 有效?","id":"rh-30"},{"kind":"p","c":[{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"场景"}]},{"t":"text","v":": 某个低概率动作(p=0.1)在一次探索中获得成功"}]},{"kind":"code","lang":"text","html":"<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>标准 PPO (clip_high=0.2):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- ratio = 0.15 / 0.1 = 1.5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- clipped_ratio = 1.2 (被限制!)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 概率最多增长 20%</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 新概率 ≤ 0.12</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Clip Higher (clip_high=0.28):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- ratio = 1.5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- clipped_ratio = 1.5 (未被限制!)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 概率可增长 50%</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 新概率 ≤ 0.15</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>结果: Clip Higher 允许更大的策略更新,鼓励探索</span></span></code></pre>"},{"kind":"hr"},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"🔍 重要概念解释","id":"rh-31"},{"kind":"heading","depth":4,"text":"什么是\"推切(Pushcut)\"现象?","id":"rh-32"}],"codeFiles":[]}